{"id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-sequence.md","title":"Sequence","display":"df-sequence — Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sequence","aliases":["58-df-sequence","Sequence"],"display":"df-sequence — Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sequence</span><span>Sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequence — Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,X\\in V\">\\(a,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Sequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (sequence predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\operatorname{Sequence}_S(a,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\operatorname{Sequence}_S(a,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sequence: function from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> to space; fundamental concept in analysis</li>\n<li>Convergence: in metric space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,d)\">\\((X,d)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_n \\to x \\iff d(x_n, x) \\to 0\">\\(x_n \\to x \\iff d(x_n, x) \\to 0\\)</span></li>\n<li>Cauchy: no Cauchy sequence can have two distinct cluster points; uniqueness of limit</li>\n<li>The equivalence of Cauchy and convergent sequences requires completeness of the ambient space.</li>\n<li>Subsequence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a_{n_k})\">\\((a_{n_k})\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_1 &lt; n_2 &lt; \\cdots\">\\(n_1 &lt; n_2 &lt; \\cdots\\)</span>; Bolzano-Weierstrass: bounded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> has convergent subsequence</li>\n<li>Limit superior/inferior: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\limsup a_n = \\inf_N \\sup_{n \\geq N} a_n\">\\(\\limsup a_n = \\inf_N \\sup_{n \\geq N} a_n\\)</span>; always exists for bounded real sequences</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n<li>Abbott, Understanding Analysis</li>\n<li>Bartle and Sherbert, Introduction to Real Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\operatorname{Sequence}_S(a,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"x_n \\to x \\iff d(x_n, x) \\to 0","display":false},{"tex":"(a_{n_k})","display":false},{"tex":"n_1 < n_2 < \\cdots","display":false},{"tex":"\\implies","display":false},{"tex":"\\limsup a_n = \\inf_N \\sup_{n \\geq N} a_n","display":false}],"bytes":1336,"backlinks":[{"id":"2bd16e25117a1eaa","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(x_\\bullet,X)$ 且 $x\\in X$（see [[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]）"},{"id":"6af3724906d8a547","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]])"},{"id":"37e6b9b5eadcc91a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da478762d021f626","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)$ (sequence predicate, see [[58-df-sequence]])"},{"id":"9d0899f41785970a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]])."},{"id":"c1a143ccca4cbc32","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (sequence predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]])"},{"id":"74e6deaf7272b34d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c9bc37149b696d79","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9deaf304c4a0c310","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(c,X)$ (sequence predicate, see [[58-df-sequence]])"},{"id":"eb45c0923e6f897d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s:\\omega\\to P$ (descending sequence, see [[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]])"},{"id":"4ed6a5f84f08e526","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\vec f=\\langle f_\\xi:\\xi<\\lambda\\rangle$ (sequence, see [[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]])"},{"id":"e1275c40f030ae92","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6c68e3aece7c6ffc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-sequence]])"},{"id":"20062696369ac5af","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1e645227245eab34","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3572833ac7e7389b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md|58-df-sequence]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}